# Main, then the staging environment, then production

Sealvo has one long-lived branch. `main` is that branch. Staging and production are environments, not branches.

- Open a pull request into `main`. Do not push to `main` directly.
- Do not open a feature pull request into the `staging` branch. That branch is not the integration line.
- A push to `main` builds one image, deploys it to the staging environment, runs E2E, then deploys production with the same image.
- Do not change `www.sealvo.it.com` or `api.sealvo.it.com` DNS as part of an application change. DNS is a separate change.
